  "name": "K-RAS MUTATION ANALYSIS (12,13 AND 61)",
  "code": "2416",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1427\" data-end=\"1616\">\n<p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1616\"><strong data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1451\">Mutation Detected:</strong> Presence of mutation(s) in K-RAS codons 12, 13, or 61 indicates potential resistance to anti-EGFR therapies and impacts prognosis in colorectal and other cancers.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1617\" data-end=\"1721\">\n<p data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1721\"><strong data-start=\"1619\" data-end=\"1644\">No Mutation Detected:</strong> Wild-type K-RAS, patient may be eligible for anti-EGFR targeted therapies.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1722\" data-end=\"1806\">\n<p data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1806\"><strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1733\">Note:</strong> Results must be correlated with clinical and histopathological findings.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
